path	breadcrumb
sql/statements/copy/index.md#COPY#COPY_..._FROM#Syntax	COPY / COPY ... FROM
sql/statements/copy/index.md#COPY#COPY_..._TO#Syntax	COPY / COPY ... TO
sql/statements/copy/index.md#COPY#COPY_FROM_DATABASE_..._TO#Syntax	COPY / COPY FROM DATABASE ... TO

query
